	"name": "Store the Model in a Postable Format",
	"description": "As an architect, I want to package an Aurora model into a single portable file (for example, a ZIP) so that I can transport it between instances and share it reliably. This card is retained only as a legacy tombstone for historical continuity; it used a non-canonical prefix and has been superseded by `STR-004` (and the active story `STR-003`).",
